<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <style>
      body {
        padding: 50px;
        font:
          18px "Lucida Grande",
          Helvetica,
          Arial,
          sans-serif;
      }
      img {
        width: 50%;
      }
      a {
        color: #00b7ff;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1><%= title %></h1>
    <p>
      Welcome to <%= title %> page. Whether you are looking for serene mountain
      escapes, vibrant city breaks, or hidden coastal paradises, we bring you
      the world’s most breathtaking destinations. Explore curated travel guides,
      insider tips, and hidden gems designed to make your next journey
      unforgettable. Start exploring today and turn your travel dreams into
      reality.
    </p>
    <figure>
      <img
        src="/images/ladakh.jpg"
        style="border: 5px solid #333333; border-radius: 10px"
        alt="Man riding bike on ladakh roads"
      />
      <figcaption>Person riding bike on ladakh</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </body>
</html>
